<h1>Job 3 Specification: factsToMccaJob (FACTS RFR Monthly Batch Job)</h1>
<h2>1. Executive Summary &amp; Job Overview</h2>
<table>
<tr>
<th>Attribute</th>
<th>Details</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Job Name / ID</b></td>
<td><code>factsToMccaJob</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Source System</b></td>
<td><b>FACTS</b> (Ingested via Informatica IICS directly into AlloyDB staging tables <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR*</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Schedule / Frequency</b></td>
<td>Monthly (Runs on the 1st of the month at <code>12:01 AM</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Spring XML Configs</b></td>
<td><code>jobs/rfrBatchJob.xml</code> (<code>&lt;batch:job id=&quot;factsToMccaJob&quot;&gt;</code>), <code>common/beanInfo.xml</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Input Staging Tables</b></td>
<td><code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR</code>, <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Mapping &amp; Control Tables</b></td>
<td><code>IPM_FACTS_CLAIM_MAPPING_TABLE</code>, <code>IPM_FACTS_CLID_MAPPING_TABLE</code>, <code>MCCA_CODES_DECODE</code>, <code>MCCA_EXCEPTION</code>, <code>MCCA_LAST_BILL_DATE</code>, <code>MCCA_REMARKS</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Main Target Tables</b></td>
<td><code>MCCA_RFR</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code> (plus 9 tables updated during IPM-to-FACTS claim/CLID conversion in Step 1)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>External API Called</b></td>
<td><b>MCCA MMS REST API</b> — <code>POST /api/v1/Claim/Rfr</code> (Authenticated via ADFS OAuth2 <code>client_credentials</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Generated Excel Reports &amp; Email</b></td>
<td>Step 7 (<code>RFRReportAttachedMailImpl.java</code>) generates and attaches two Excel workbooks:<br/>1. <code>rfrProcessingReport.xls</code> (Pre- vs. Post-processing amounts &amp; status <code>SB</code>/<code>RJ</code>/<code>PN</code>)<br/>2. <code>missingDatesReport.xls</code> (Paylog lines with missing <code>STRT_DATE</code> or <code>END_DT</code>)</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2>2. End-to-End Architecture &amp; Step Execution Flow</h2>
<p><code>factsToMccaJob</code> executes <b>8 sequential steps</b> (with conditional stop if Step 1 fails sanity checks):</p>
<pre>[Step 1: ipmFactsMappingUpdateStep] (IPMFactsMappingUtil.java [jobType=&apos;rfr&apos;] &amp; IPMFactsMappingUpdateDaoImpl.java)
       ├──► [Status = FAILED] ──► (Stops job if any of the 8 staging sanity checks fail)
       │
       ▼ [Status = COMPLETED]
[Step 2: rfrFactsPreLoadStep] (rfrFactsPaylogJdbcPreReader -&gt; RFRFactsPayLogPreRowMapper)
       │ (Aggregates pre-processing billed, review fee, repriced paid, and MCCA payment amounts per claim into batchReport)
       ▼
[Step 3: rfrFactsMissingDatesStep] (rfrFactsPaylogJdbcMissingDatesReader -&gt; MissingDatesBatchReportMapper)
       │ (Queries MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG where STRT_DATE IS NULL OR END_DT IS NULL into missingDatesReport)
       ▼
[Step 4: rfrFactsHeaderStep] (RfrFactsHeaderProcessor.java)
       │ (Reads MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR + Paylogs + CPTs -&gt; Checks AutoBillingException -&gt; Runs RFRValidator, DataValidator &amp; March 2022 Rules
       │  -&gt; Sets uniqueKey = carrierClaimNumber + yyyyMMdd -&gt; Calls MMS REST API if valid -&gt; Updates MCCA_LAST_BILL_DATE &amp; MCCA_REMARKS
       │  -&gt; Inserts Paylogs into MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG &amp; Header into MCCA_RFR)
       ▼
[Step 5: rfrFactsDetailCptStep] (RfrFactsDetailCptProcessor.java)
       │ (Sets uniqueKey = carrierClaimNumber + yyyyMMdd and inserts CPT rows from MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT into MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT)
       ▼
[Step 6: rfrFactsPostStep] (RfrFactsPaylogPostProcessor.java)
       │ (Joins MCCA_RFR, MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG, MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR to populate post-processing amounts and status [&apos;SB&apos;, &apos;RJ&apos;, &apos;PN&apos;] into batchReport)
       ▼
[Step 7: rfrMail] (RFRReportAttachedMailImpl.java)
       │ (Builds rfrProcessingReport.xls and missingDatesReport.xls in memory/temp and emails them to business recipients)
       ▼
[Step 8: clearTempTables] (DBUtils.java)
       │ (Deletes all rows from MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT, MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG, MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR)</pre>
<h2>3. Detailed Step-by-Step Business Logic, Conditions &amp; SQL Queries</h2>
<h3>Step 1: ipmFactsMappingUpdateStep (IPMFactsMappingUtil.java &amp; IPMFactsMappingUpdateDaoImpl.java)</h3>
<p>Although the standalone IPM batch job is retired, historical IPM claims converted into FACTS still arrive in <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR</code> and <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> carrying <code>IPM_CLM_NUM</code> and <code>IPM_CLID_NUM</code> values. Step 1 validates the FACTS staging tables and updates converted claim/claimant numbers across the database.</p>
<h4>3.1.1 Eight Staging Table Sanity Checks (performSanityChecksOnTempTables)</h4>
<p>Before updating any mapping tables, <code>IPMFactsMappingUtil</code> runs 8 SQL count checks. If <b>any</b> of checks 1–7 return <code>&gt; 0</code>, or check 8 returns <code>0</code>, Step 1 returns <code>ExitStatus.FAILED</code> and halts the job:</p>
<p>1. <b><code>getDuplicatesCountFromClaimMappingTable</code></b>: Checks for duplicate <code>IPM_CLM_NUM</code> or <code>FACTS_CLM_NUM</code> in <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR</code>:</p>
<p>```sql</p>
<p>SELECT COUNT(*) FROM (</p>
<p>SELECT ipm_clm_num, COUNT(ipm_clm_num) FROM mcca.mcca_fac_tmp_rfr GROUP BY ipm_clm_num HAVING COUNT(ipm_clm_num) &gt; 1</p>
<p>UNION ALL</p>
<p>SELECT carrier_clm_num, COUNT(carrier_clm_num) FROM mcca.mcca_fac_tmp_rfr GROUP BY carrier_clm_num HAVING COUNT(carrier_clm_num) &gt; 1</p>
<p>);</p>
<p>```</p>
<p>2. <b><code>getConflictsCountForClaimMapping</code></b>: Checks if <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR</code> conflicts with existing mappings in <code>IPM_FACTS_CLAIM_MAPPING_TABLE</code>.</p>
<p>3. <b><code>getMissingIpmClaimsCountFromClaimMapping</code></b>: Checks if any <code>CARRIER_CLM_NUM</code> in <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR</code> already mapped in <code>IPM_FACTS_CLAIM_MAPPING_TABLE</code> is missing its <code>IPM_CLM_NUM</code>.</p>
<p>4. <b><code>getCountOfClaimsWithFeatureCountMismatch</code></b>: Checks if a claim in <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> has a mixed presence of <code>IPM_CLID_NUM</code> (some rows null, some non-null) or mismatches <code>IPM_FACTS_CLID_MAPPING_TABLE</code>.</p>
<p>5. <b><code>getDuplicatesCountFromClidMappingTable</code></b>: Checks for duplicate <code>(CARRIER_CLM_NUM, CARRIER_CLMT_NUM)</code> or <code>(IPM_CLM_NUM, IPM_CLID_NUM)</code> in <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>.</p>
<p>6. <b><code>getConflictsCountForClidMapping</code></b>: Checks if <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> CLID mappings conflict with <code>IPM_FACTS_CLID_MAPPING_TABLE</code>.</p>
<p>7. <b><code>getMissingIpmClidsCountFromClidMapping</code></b>: Checks if any <code>(CARRIER_CLM_NUM, CARRIER_CLMT_NUM)</code> in <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> already mapped in <code>IPM_FACTS_CLID_MAPPING_TABLE</code> is missing <code>IPM_CLM_NUM</code> or <code>IPM_CLID_NUM</code>.</p>
<p>8. <b><code>getReimbursmentRequestRecordsCount</code></b>:</p>
<p>```sql</p>
<p>SELECT COUNT(*) FROM mcca.mcca_fac_tmp_rfr;</p>
<p>-- Must be &gt; 0 (if 0, job fails with &quot;No data found in RFR temp tables&quot;)</p>
<p>```</p>
<h4>3.1.2 Updating Mapping Tables &amp; 9 Target Tables (updateIPMFactsMappingAndDependentTables)</h4>
<p>If all 8 checks pass:</p>
<p>1. Reads current version from <code>MCCA_CODES_DECODE</code> (<code>WHERE CODE_TYPE = &apos;ipm_facts_mapping_version&apos;</code>) and increments by <code>1</code>.</p>
<p>2. Inserts newly discovered <code>(IPM_CLM_NUM, CARRIER_CLM_NUM)</code> pairs from <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR</code> into <code>IPM_FACTS_CLAIM_MAPPING_TABLE</code> with <code>VERSION = newVersion</code>.</p>
<p>3. Inserts newly discovered <code>(IPM_CLM_NUM, IPM_CLID_NUM, CARRIER_CLM_NUM, CARRIER_CLMT_NUM)</code> tuples from <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> into <code>IPM_FACTS_CLID_MAPPING_TABLE</code> with <code>VERSION = newVersion</code>.</p>
<p>4. Updates <code>CARRIER_CLM_NUM</code> (from <code>IPM_CLM_NUM</code> to <code>FACTS_CLM_NUM</code>) and <code>CLM_TYPE = &apos;FACTS&apos;</code> across <b>9 tables</b> for <code>VERSION = newVersion</code>:</p>
<p>- <code>MCCA_CLM</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, <code>MCCA_LAST_BILL_DATE</code>, <code>MCCA_WRITE_OFF</code>, <code>MCCA_HIST</code>, <code>MCCA_REMARKS</code>, <code>MCCA_EXCEPTION</code>, <code>MCCA_OTHR_INJ_CLMTS_PYMT</code>.</p>
<p>5. Updates <code>CARRIER_CLMT_NUM</code> (and <code>UNIQUE_ID = FACTS_CLM_NUM || &apos;-&apos; || FACTS_CLID_NUM</code> in <code>MCCA_CLM</code>) across <code>MCCA_CLM</code>, <code>MCCA_LAST_BILL_DATE</code>, and <code>MCCA_EXCEPTION</code> using <code>IPM_FACTS_CLID_MAPPING_TABLE</code>.</p>
<p>6. Updates <code>MCCA_CODES_DECODE SET CODE = newVersion WHERE CODE_TYPE = &apos;ipm_facts_mapping_version&apos;</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 2: rfrFactsPreLoadStep (RFRFactsPayLogPreRowMapper.java)</h3>
<p>Aggregates pre-processing paylog totals per claim from <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> and stores them in the in-memory <code>batchReport</code> map (<code>Map&lt;String, RFRBatchReport&gt;</code> keyed by <code>carrierClaimNumber</code>):</p>
<pre>SELECT
    CARRIER_CLM_NUM,
    CARRIER_CLMT_NUM,
    FST_NAME,
    LST_NAME,
    MIDL_INT,
    SUM(BILLED_AMT) AS BILLED_AMT,
    SUM(BILL_REVIEW_FEES) AS BILL_REVIEW_FEES,
    SUM(REP_PAID_AMT) AS REP_PAID_AMT,
    SUM(TOT_MCCA_PMT_REQ) AS TOT_MCCA_PMT_REQ
FROM MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG
GROUP BY CARRIER_CLM_NUM, CARRIER_CLMT_NUM, FST_NAME, LST_NAME, MIDL_INT
ORDER BY CARRIER_CLM_NUM;</pre>
<p>- Concatenates claimant name as <code>LST_NAME + &quot; &quot; + FST_NAME + &quot; &quot; + MIDL_INT</code> (handled safely for nulls).</p>
<p>- Populates <code>preBilledAmt</code>, <code>preBillReviewFees</code>, <code>preRepricedPaidAmt</code>, <code>preTotalMccaPmtReq</code> in <code>batchReport</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 3: rfrFactsMissingDatesStep (MissingDatesBatchReportMapper.java)</h3>
<p>Queries <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> for any paylog rows missing service start or end dates and stores them in <code>missingDatesReport</code> (<code>List&lt;MissingDatesBatchReport&gt;</code>):</p>
<pre>SELECT
    CARRIER_CLM_NUM,
    CARRIER_CLMT_NUM,
    FST_NAME,
    LST_NAME,
    MIDL_INT,
    PAY_CD,
    CHK_NUM,
    CHK_DT,
    PAYEE_OR_PRVDR,
    BILLED_AMT,
    BILL_REVIEW_FEES,
    REP_PAID_AMT,
    TOT_MCCA_PMT_REQ
FROM MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG
WHERE STRT_DATE IS NULL OR END_DT IS NULL;</pre>
<h3>Step 4: rfrFactsHeaderStep (RfrFactsHeaderProcessor.java, RFRValidator.java, DataValidator.java)</h3>
<p>Reads every header from <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR</code>:</p>
<pre>SELECT
    TXN_ID, UNIQUE_ID, REC_TYPE, CARRIER_ID, CARRIER_CLM_NUM, CARRIER_CLMT_NUM,
    MCCA_CLM_NUM, BILL_SEQ_NUM, INS_FST_NAME, INS_MIDL_INIT, INS_LST_NAME,
    ADJ_NAME, LOSS_DT, CLMT_FST_NAME, CLMT_MIDL_INIT, CLMT_LST_NAME,
    TOT_AMT_BILLED, TOT_BILL_RVIEW_FEES, TOT_MCCA_PMT_REQ, X_COMPANION_CLM_IND,
    X_COMPANION_CLM_NUM, CRT_DTTM, CRT_USER_ID, MDFD_DTTM, MDFD_USER_ID,
    TRANS_SENT_DT, STATUS, ERR_ELE_LIST, CLM_TYPE, CHNG_RSN_DESC, DEDUCTIBLE_AMT
FROM MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR;</pre>
<h4>Complete Matrix of Step 4 Validations &amp; Processing Rules (RfrFactsHeaderProcessor):</h4>
<p>1. <b>Unique Key Generation</b>:</p>
<p>- Generates <code>uniqueKey = rfr.getCarrierClaimNumber().trim() + DateFormat(&quot;yyyyMMdd&quot;).format(new Date())</code>.</p>
<p>- Sets <code>rfr.setUniqueKey(uniqueKey)</code> and <code>rfr.setClaimType(&quot;FACTS&quot;)</code>.</p>
<p>2. <b>Auto-Billing Exception Check (<code>getAutoBillingException</code>)</b>:</p>
<p>- Queries <code>MCCA_EXCEPTION</code>:</p>
<p>```sql</p>
<p>SELECT COUNT(*) FROM mcca.mcca_exception</p>
<p>WHERE carrier_clm_num = ? AND carrier_clmt_num = ?</p>
<p>AND exception_code = &apos;3&apos; AND exception_value = &apos;Y&apos;;</p>
<p>```</p>
<p>- If <code>COUNT(*) &gt; 0</code>: sets <code>pendingStatus = true</code>.</p>
<p>3. <b>Previous RFR Pending Check (<code>isPreviousRfrSubmitted</code>)</b>:</p>
<p>- Queries <code>MCCA_RFR</code> for the latest <code>TXN_ID</code> per <code>UNIQUE_ID</code> for <code>CARRIER_CLM_NUM</code> where <code>STATUS = &apos;PN&apos;</code>.</p>
<p>- If <code>COUNT(*) &gt; 0</code>: sets <code>pendingStatus = true</code>.</p>
<p>4. <b>Header Validation (<code>RFRValidator.validate(rfr)</code> &amp; <code>DataValidator</code>)</b>:</p>
<p>- Checks <code>totalMccaPaymentReq &gt; (totalAmtBilled + totalBillReviewFees)</code>.</p>
<p>- Checks <code>crossCompanionClaimNumber != null &amp;&amp; !isEmpty()</code>.</p>
<p>- Checks <code>billSequenceNumber</code> in <code>(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;001&quot;)</code>.</p>
<p>- Checks <code>DataValidator.isNull(rfr.getMccaClaimNumber())</code> -&gt; if null/empty, sets <code>pendingStatus = true</code>, appends <code>&quot;mccaClaimNumber&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- Checks <code>DataValidator.isNull(rfr.getInsuredFirstName())</code> AND <code>DataValidator.isNull(rfr.getInsuredLastName())</code> -&gt; if both null/empty, sets <code>pendingStatus = true</code>, appends <code>&quot;insuredFirstName,insuredLastName&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>5. <b>Paylog &amp; CPT Level Validations (for each paylog in <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> where <code>CARRIER_CLM_NUM = ?</code>)</b>:</p>
<p>- Assigns <code>rfrDetail.setUniqueKey(uniqueKey)</code> and <code>rfrDetail.setClaimType(&quot;FACTS&quot;)</code>.</p>
<p>- Fetches child CPT records from <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code> (<code>WHERE CARRIER_CLM_NUM = ? AND CARRIER_PAYLOG_ID = ?</code>).</p>
<p>- <b><code>isBillAmountValid</code></b>: <code>billAmount &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; totalMccaPaymentReq &gt; billAmount</code>.</p>
<p>- <b><code>isCorrection</code></b>: <code>payeeOrProvider</code> equals <code>&quot;CORRECTIONS&quot;</code> or <code>&quot;SAL/SUB RECEIPT&quot;</code> -&gt; sets <code>correctionsIndicator = &quot;Y&quot;</code>, <code>pendingStatus = true</code>, appends <code>&quot;payeeOrProvider&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- <b><code>isServiceDatesValid</code></b>: If <code>serviceStartDate == null || serviceEndDate == null</code> -&gt; sets <code>pendingStatus = true</code>, appends <code>&quot;serviceStartDate,serviceEndDate&quot;</code>. Else if <code>serviceStartDate.after(serviceEndDate)</code> -&gt; sets <code>pendingStatus = true</code>, appends <code>&quot;serviceStartDate&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- <b>Mandatory String Fields (<code>DataValidator.isNull</code>)</b>:</p>
<p>- <code>checkNumber</code> null/empty -&gt; appends <code>&quot;checkNumber&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- <code>payCode</code> null/empty -&gt; appends <code>&quot;payCode&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- <code>payeeOrProvider</code> null/empty -&gt; appends <code>&quot;payeeOrProvider&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- <code>serviceDescription</code> null/empty -&gt; appends <code>&quot;serviceDescription&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- <b><code>isBillTypeValid</code></b>: <code>billType</code> in <code>(&quot;MISC&quot;, &quot;1500&quot;, &quot;UB04&quot;)</code> and if <code>serviceEndDate &lt; rfrCptEffectiveDate</code>, <code>billType</code> must be <code>&quot;MISC&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- <b><code>isServiceFacilityZipValid</code></b>: If <code>billType</code> in <code>(&quot;1500&quot;, &quot;UB04&quot;)</code>, <code>serviceFacilityZipcode</code> must not be empty.</p>
<p>- <b><code>isCptRequired</code> &amp; <code>isCptListValid</code></b>: If <code>billType</code> in <code>(&quot;1500&quot;, &quot;UB04&quot;)</code>, CPT list must be non-empty and pass all CPT field rules.</p>
<p>- <b>March 2022 Validations</b>: <code>validateTINNPI</code>, <code>validateUBBillTypeField</code>, <code>validateCPTCodes</code>, <code>validateNonMandatoryCPTCodes</code>, <code>validateRevenueCodes</code>, <code>validatePayCodeBillType</code>.</p>
<p>6. <b>MMS REST API Submission</b>:</p>
<p>- If <code>pendingStatus == false</code>:</p>
<p>- Calls <code>RfrRestMapper</code> + <code>RfrJsonBuilder</code> + <code>RfrRestClient</code> (<code>POST /api/v1/Claim/Rfr</code>).</p>
<p>- If HTTP 200 / no errors: sets <code>statusIndicator = &quot;SB&quot;</code> and <code>transactionSentDate = new Date()</code>.</p>
<p>- If error response: sets <code>statusIndicator = &quot;PN&quot;</code> and <code>submitErrMsg = err[:740]</code>.</p>
<p>- If <code>pendingStatus == true</code>:</p>
<p>- Sets <code>statusIndicator = &quot;PN&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>7. <b>Post-Header Database Updates (<code>MCCA_LAST_BILL_DATE</code>, <code>MCCA_REMARKS</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR</code>)</b>:</p>
<p>- <b><code>updateLastBillingDate</code></b>:</p>
<p>- If <code>rfr.getChangeReasonDescription()</code> equals <code>&quot;Fall Below&quot;</code> (case-insensitive):</p>
<p>```sql</p>
<p>UPDATE mcca.mcca_last_bill_date</p>
<p>SET last_bill_dt = SYSDATE, mdfd_dttm = SYSDATE, fall_back_ind = &apos;Y&apos;</p>
<p>WHERE carrier_clm_num = ? AND carrier_clmt_num = ?;</p>
<p>```</p>
<p>And inserts a remark into <code>MCCA_REMARKS</code>:</p>
<p>```sql</p>
<p>INSERT INTO mcca.mcca_remarks (REMARK_SEQ_NUM, UNIQUE_ID, REMARKS, CRT_DTTM, CRT_USER_ID, MDFD_DTTM, MDFD_USER_ID)</p>
<p>VALUES (mcca.mcca_remark_seq.NEXTVAL, :carrierClaimNumber || &apos;-&apos; || :carrierClaimantNumber, &apos;RFR Fall Below&apos;, SYSDATE, &apos;BATCH&apos;, SYSDATE, &apos;BATCH&apos;);</p>
<p>```</p>
<p>- Else:</p>
<p>```sql</p>
<p>UPDATE mcca.mcca_last_bill_date</p>
<p>SET last_bill_dt = SYSDATE, mdfd_dttm = SYSDATE</p>
<p>WHERE carrier_clm_num = ? AND carrier_clmt_num = ?;</p>
<p>```</p>
<p>- Writes all paylogs for the header into <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code> (<code>RFRPayLogWriter</code>).</p>
<p>- Writes the header into <code>MCCA_RFR</code> (<code>RFRWriter</code>).</p>
<h3>Step 5: rfrFactsDetailCptStep (RfrFactsDetailCptProcessor.java)</h3>
<p>Reads all rows from <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code>, sets <code>uniqueKey = carrierClaimNumber.trim() + yyyyMMdd</code>, and inserts them into <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code> via <code>RFRPayLogCptWriter</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 6: rfrFactsPostStep (RfrFactsPaylogPostProcessor.java &amp; RFRFactsPayLogPostRowMapper.java)</h3>
<p>Executes the post-processing aggregation query joining <code>MCCA_RFR</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, and <code>MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR</code>:</p>
<pre>SELECT
    RFR.CARRIER_CLM_NUM,
    RFR.STATUS,
    RFR.SUBMIT_ERR_MSG,
    SUM(PAYLOG.BILLED_AMT) AS BILLED_AMT,
    SUM(PAYLOG.BILL_REVIEW_FEES) AS BILL_REVIEW_FEES,
    SUM(PAYLOG.REP_PAID_AMT) AS REP_PAID_AMT,
    SUM(PAYLOG.TOT_MCCA_PMT_REQ) AS TOT_MCCA_PMT_REQ
FROM MCCA_RFR RFR, MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG PAYLOG, MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR TMPRFR
WHERE RFR.UNIQUE_ID = PAYLOG.UNIQUE_ID
  AND RFR.CARRIER_CLM_NUM = TMPRFR.CARRIER_CLM_NUM
  AND RFR.TXN_ID IN (
      SELECT MAX(RFR2.TXN_ID) FROM MCCA_RFR RFR2 WHERE RFR2.UNIQUE_ID = RFR.UNIQUE_ID
  )
GROUP BY RFR.CARRIER_CLM_NUM, RFR.STATUS, RFR.SUBMIT_ERR_MSG
ORDER BY RFR.CARRIER_CLM_NUM;</pre>
<p>- <b>Status Override Rule in <code>RFRFactsPayLogPostRowMapper</code></b>:</p>
<p>- If <code>SUBMIT_ERR_MSG != null &amp;&amp; !SUBMIT_ERR_MSG.isEmpty()</code>, overrides <code>status</code> from <code>&apos;PN&apos;</code> to <b><code>&apos;RJ&apos;</code></b> (Rejected by MMS API) for the Excel report!</p>
<p>- Updates the matching <code>RFRBatchReport</code> entry in <code>batchReport</code> with <code>postBilledAmt</code>, <code>postBillReviewFees</code>, <code>postRepricedPaidAmt</code>, <code>postTotalMccaPmtReq</code>, and <code>status</code> (<code>SB</code>, <code>RJ</code>, or <code>PN</code>).</p>
<h3>Step 7: rfrMail (RFRReportAttachedMailImpl.java)</h3>
<p>Generates two Excel files and sends them as email attachments:</p>
<p>1. <b><code>rfrProcessingReport.xls</code></b> (Sheet: <code>RFR Batch Processing Summary</code>):</p>
<p>- <b>12 Columns</b>:</p>
<p><code>Claim Number | Claimant Number | Claimant Name | Pre Billed Amt | Pre Bill Review Fee | Pre Repriced Paid Amt | Pre Total MCCA Payment Req | Post Billed Amt | Post Bill Review Fee | Post Repriced Paid Amt | Post Total MCCA Payment Req | Status</code></p>
<p>- Includes a bottom <code>Total</code> row summing all 8 currency columns, plus summary counts for:</p>
<p>- <code>Total Claims Count</code></p>
<p>- <code>Claims Submitted Count</code> (<code>status == &quot;SB&quot;</code>)</p>
<p>- <code>Claims Rejected Count</code> (<code>status == &quot;RJ&quot;</code>)</p>
<p>- <code>Claims Pended Count</code> (<code>status == &quot;PN&quot;</code>)</p>
<p>2. <b><code>missingDatesReport.xls</code></b> (Sheet: <code>Service Dates Missing Paylogs</code>):</p>
<p>- <b>11 Columns</b>:</p>
<p><code>Claim Number | Claimant Number | Claimant Name | Pay Code | Check Number | Check Date | Payee/Provider | Billed Amt | Bill Review Fee | Repriced Paid Amt | Total MCCA Payment Req</code></p>
<h3>Step 8: clearTempTables (DBUtils.java)</h3>
<p>Cleans up all 3 FACTS RFR temporary tables:</p>
<pre>DELETE FROM MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT;
DELETE FROM MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG;
DELETE FROM MCCA_FAC_TMP_RFR;</pre>
</body></html>
